Ported from Lichii PR #184 (https://github.com/zortos293/Lichii/pull/184), its "sorted page
batches" path: tracker page runs are coalesced in place and, when already sorted and apart,
counted without the two heap copies. Without the Nx2Perf switch and its verify mode.

